        "en": "Dedicated and compassionate veterinary team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers express exceptional appreciation for the veterinarians and staff at Roscoe Village Animal Hospital. Doctors like Dr. Garrison, Dr. Turkel, Dr. Mursuli, and Dr. Callahan receive frequent compliments for their patience, clinical skill, and warm bedside manner. Long-term clients emphasize that the entire clinic team consistently provides reliable and thoughtful care."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 14,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling and personalized attention"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently note how calm and comfortable their dogs and cats remain during visits. Reviewers highlight that doctors take extra time to get to know individual pets, easing anxiety even during injections or surgical evaluations. Clients appreciate the staff's genuine affection for animals, from young puppies to senior companions."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 6,
      "title": {
        "en": "Thorough explanations and helpful coordination"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Communication from the veterinary team is highly regarded by pet owners. Clinicians take ample time to answer questions, explain complex procedures like PRP therapy, and reassure anxious owners throughout surgeries. Reviewers also appreciate smooth coordination, such as sending medical records promptly when specialized emergent care is required."
      }
    }
  ],
